CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'pbpctl_dev->bp_ext_ver >= 0x8'
#1023: FILE: drivers/staging/silicom/bpctl_mod.c:1825:
+	if ((pbpctl_dev->bp_caps & DISC_CAP) &&
+	    (pbpctl_dev->bp_ext_ver >= 0x8)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

